      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY HEIGHTY (1) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a head (26.19) behind Young Rufus at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Key chance in this line up. BENGAL BEAST (4) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing third (26.36) at this track in a Grade 5 over 460m. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. ASTON TARZAN (6) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (26.48) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. ASSUME FLOPPY (2) is worth a look over a shorter trip this time.",
